Coverage of xbar +- 1.96 s/sqrt(n) for Pareto(alpha) incomes, x_m = 1
 alpha   mean     n=50    n=200   n=1000   n=5000
   1.5  3.000    0.680    0.726    0.767    0.788
   2.5  1.667    0.850    0.897    0.936    0.933
